From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Update Mesa to 26.2.4

Apply the complete upstream stable release delta from 31e9a6b2e95e30d84bf3177d1f497d063e59b6b2
to 96cb43121031992b85767f9c1be8f3f48e22b1d2 on the pinned Lineage tree.
Preserve its Android build and integration changes. The 26.2.3 release
checksums were already present. This update does not enable PowerVR.

